Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Scalar scattering with the John interaction", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"5d1f03b3-81cd-450a-bd24-3593ddf37719"],

Cell["\<\
Tree-level p1 + p2 \[RightArrow] p3 + p4 scattering of identical real scalars \
with arbitrary mass m. The action contains the canonical massive scalar \
coupled to GR and the John term beta G^(mu nu) partial_mu phi partial_nu phi, \
with no extra factor of 1/2 and no scalar self-potential. Start in a fresh \
kernel and evaluate from top to bottom. This example follows example 09 and \
uses the same momentum and amplitude conventions.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"77950762-37cd-4d98-9493-f8eb69e3433e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

